WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.600
We start this

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.101
morning with

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:03.003
some really incredible new video

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.537
out of southern Ukraine.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.905
It shows the aftermath

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:06.773
of a purported

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.375
Ukrainian attack

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.643
on the Russian occupied city of Moloto.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.846
This is one of several explosions

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.781
overnight felt in southern Ukraine

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.883
and on the Crimean peninsula.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:17.384
Russian state

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:18.718
media is also reporting missile

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.553
strikes in eastern Ukraine

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.288
and the self-proclaimed Donetsk

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.490
People's Republic.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.891
Now, the attacks come hours

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:26.493
after a barrage of Russian

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.628
drone strikes across Ukraine.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.362
And President

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.430
Vladimir Zelensky

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.732
says five Iranian drones

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.035
hit key power facilities around

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.503
Odessa Saturday,

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.537
knocking out power

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.271
to more than one

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.473
and a half million people.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.575
CNN's Sam Kiley is live for us

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.210
now from Kiev.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.812
Sam, give us an update on

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:49.682
on what all these new developments mean

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.652
Well, first of all, the Odessa strikes.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.154
I think the significance there is

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.155
that these were made

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:56.256
according to the Ukrainian

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.123
Ukrainian government

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:00.927
by the Iranian supplied side drones.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:03.630
These are Iranian missiles

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.732
that are pretty primitive, cheap to make.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.767
But there had been an assumption

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.569
by the from the Ukrainians

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.538
that they were running low on

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:13.173
or had run out of entirely

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:14.974
these Iranian made drones.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:15.708
Now, the

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.278
they fired some 15 five got through.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:19.245
They've crippled

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.047
temporarily the power supply

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.348
to a DSLR, a city of over

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:23.149
a million people

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.984
that has largely been spared

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.852
a lot of these attacks

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.787
on the energy infrastructure here

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.989
in Ukraine elsewhere in the country

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.859
the power system is coming back to life.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:36.396
It's down to about 75% of capacity

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:37.964
take a long time to fix it

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:40.533
in its entirety but it is a sign though

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.469
unfortunately from the Ukrainian

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:43.870
perspective that the

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:45.905
suggestion that

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.807
the Russians were running out

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.710
of these missiles is no longer the case.

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:52.645
and Sam,

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.647
we've also seen very intense

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:55.682
fighting recently

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.283
in the town of Buck move

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.352
to what's the strategic significance

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.621
since of those clashes

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:04.491
as far as

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:05.792
the Ukrainians are concerned,

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.860
they're baffled as to

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.761
why the Russians are throwing

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:09.729
so much

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.131
into the fight for Obama

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:11.731
that it doesn't

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:13.666
from the Ukrainian perspective

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.235
represent particularly important

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:16.803
strategic assets

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:18.538
as a target for the Ukrainians.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:19.172
But if you look at

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.174
what else is going on elsewhere

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:21.841
in the country

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.042
with the potential,

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:23.910
I don't think it's yet

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.444
a counter

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:26.312
offensive in places like Melita

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.814
both on the Southern Front,

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.116
it does absorb a lot of Ukrainian

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.351
military energy.

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:32.852
The casualties on both sides

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.854
are very high around Obama.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:35.822
And arguably

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.157
that is an attempt by the Russians

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.658
to make sure that the Ukrainians

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:40.160
can open up a counter

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.728
offensive elsewhere,

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:42.695
particularly in the south,

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:45.031
which is a very long front line.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:45.932
And of course, it is

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:48.601
the route to the prize, really

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.637
one of the main prizes for Ukraine

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:52.005
which would be ultimately

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:54.240
to recapture the Crimean Peninsula,

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:54.707
which has been

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.109
illegally annexed by Russia.

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:57.877
And of course, we've also seen attacks

00:02:57.877 --> 00:02:59.512
in the east of the country

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:00.213
with these longer

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:02.315
range missile strikes, potentially

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.883
signaling that the Ukrainians

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:04.684
may have developed

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:05.618
some technology

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:07.320
that they're not yet acknowledging,

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.988
but technology that is getting through

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.190
Russian air defenses

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.524
in the Crimean Peninsula,

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:11.925
in the east,

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:13.126
the country, and lately

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.761
in multiple bursts.

